WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.251
The audience were talking about it.

00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:12.818
Candy finally heard the truth
about Susanna's accident.

00:00:16.566 --> 00:00:20.095
Therefore, Candy was no more
in the mood to watch the play.

00:00:20.245 --> 00:00:23.970
And she headed to the hospital
to visit Susanna.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:33.913
Separation on a snowy day.

00:00:44.561 --> 00:00:48.158
Please, go to the Royal Hotel first
and then head to St. Jacob Hospital.

00:00:59.175 --> 00:01:01.837
Susanna was injured because of him.

00:01:01.987 --> 00:01:04.676
I heard that Terry was going to marry her.

00:01:05.882 --> 00:01:07.375
That's so cruel.

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:09.444
No matter how much she loves Terry,

00:01:09.594 --> 00:01:12.647
she shouldn’t do this to Terry.

00:01:12.923 --> 00:01:15.790
This is not love.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.127
Susanna...

00:01:18.628 --> 00:01:20.493
I want to see Susanna.

00:01:21.197 --> 00:01:25.026
Terry kept this secret from me.

00:01:25.176 --> 00:01:27.035
He must been have been struggling.

00:01:28.405 --> 00:01:32.774
Terry, forgive me
for leaving in the middle of the show.

00:01:33.109 --> 00:01:37.068
But, I can't help it...

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:48.416
If I trust the flattering truth of sleep,
My dreams presage some joyful news at hand:

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:52.154
My bosom's lord sits lightly in his throne:
And all this day an unaccustom'd spirit.

00:01:52.595 --> 00:01:56.326
Lifts me above the ground with thoughts.
I dreamt my lady came and found me dead.

00:01:56.633 --> 00:01:59.928
Strange dream, that gives
a dead man leave to think.

00:02:00.078 --> 00:02:02.938
And breathed such life with kisses,
That I revived, and was an emperor.

00:02:07.077 --> 00:02:10.376
The final scene must be about to end.

00:02:11.715 --> 00:02:14.442
Susanna, please take some rest.

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:18.613
I wonder how Terrius did in the show.

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:22.381
Don't worry, and rest well.

00:02:23.693 --> 00:02:26.526
If Terrius comes,
I will let you know.

00:02:26.896 --> 00:02:31.056
Mother, did you force him
to come again?

00:02:31.206 --> 00:02:34.796
No, I didn't.
Terrius wanted to come himself.

00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:35.897
I know you are lying.

00:02:36.047 --> 00:02:40.932
I know it. You must have forced
Terrius to come to see me.

00:02:45.115 --> 00:02:46.508
What for?

00:02:46.658 --> 00:02:49.950
I am already happy that
he was willing to come.

00:02:50.553 --> 00:02:53.283
Susanna, take some rest.

00:02:56.426 --> 00:02:59.361
The audience must love Terrius.

00:02:59.896 --> 00:03:01.864
Of course.

00:03:07.704 --> 00:03:09.130
- Mother...
- What?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.537
I want to eat strawberries.

00:03:13.143 --> 00:03:15.070
Now?

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:17.238
I want to eat strawberries.

00:03:19.749 --> 00:03:23.241
I'll see if I can find some.
You get some sleep.

00:03:28.258 --> 00:03:29.418
Mother...

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.219
What?

00:03:31.369 --> 00:03:33.091
Forgive me to be so self-centered.

00:03:34.397 --> 00:03:35.955
It's ok.

00:03:48.711 --> 00:03:52.579
I wonder if Susanna knows
how much Terry is suffering.

00:03:55.452 --> 00:03:58.113
Come, bitter conduct.

00:03:58.263 --> 00:04:00.554
Come, unsavoury guide!

00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:03.351
Thou desperate pilot.

00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:05.754
Now at once run on

00:04:05.904 --> 00:04:08.593
The dashing rocks thy sea-sick weary bark!

00:04:09.265 --> 00:04:11.426
Here's to my love!

00:04:20.143 --> 00:04:23.738
O true apothecary!
Thy drugs are quick.

00:04:27.584 --> 00:04:30.883
Thus with a kiss I die.

00:04:49.906 --> 00:04:51.237
Thank you.

00:04:51.608 --> 00:04:52.939
Thank you.

00:05:04.321 --> 00:05:06.849
Excuse me,
where is Susanna Marlowe's room?

00:05:07.099 --> 00:05:09.620
Room 15 on the second floor.

00:05:11.394 --> 00:05:12.986
Thank you.

00:05:28.044 --> 00:05:29.875
Calm down, Candy.

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.749
Miss Susanna...

00:05:39.656 --> 00:05:41.521
I wonder if she is asleep.

00:05:42.959 --> 00:05:44.517
Sorry to bother you.

00:05:51.134 --> 00:05:53.193
A wheelchair...

00:05:53.703 --> 00:05:55.430
Susanna's injury...

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.972
Susanna...

00:05:58.341 --> 00:06:00.673
I couldn't find any strawberries.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:04.945
Susanna...

00:06:07.951 --> 00:06:11.250
Where did Susanna go?
Where is Susanna?

00:06:12.222 --> 00:06:14.315
When I came...

00:06:14.465 --> 00:06:17.757
She wanted me to buy
some strawberries.

00:06:19.529 --> 00:06:21.019
Susanna...

00:06:22.565 --> 00:06:23.827
Susanna!

00:06:36.879 --> 00:06:39.970
She wants to die!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.085
Doctor!

00:06:50.893 --> 00:06:52.656
I am sorry, mother.

00:06:52.862 --> 00:06:56.696
Please don't blame Terry.
I love him.

00:06:57.033 --> 00:06:59.661
Forgive my foolishness

00:07:00.136 --> 00:07:03.537
I wish your happiness
Susanna.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.339
Susanna!

00:07:09.779 --> 00:07:11.713
Susanna!

00:07:12.015 --> 00:07:13.308
Miss Susanna!

00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:15.977
Susanna!

00:07:16.686 --> 00:07:19.217
Miss Susanna!

00:07:36.873 --> 00:07:39.103
Miss Susanna!

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.041
Miss Juliet...

00:07:46.883 --> 00:07:49.818
Yea, noise? Then I'll be brief.

00:07:52.322 --> 00:07:54.449
O happy dagger!

00:07:58.528 --> 00:08:01.497
This is thy sheath;

00:08:11.174 --> 00:08:14.337
there rust, and let me die.

00:08:28.524 --> 00:08:30.492
Susanna!

00:08:44.474 --> 00:08:46.975
Don't worry,
we will find Miss Susanna.

00:08:48.044 --> 00:08:49.272
Susanna...

00:08:52.281 --> 00:08:55.273
- Did you find her?
- Not yet.

00:08:56.018 --> 00:08:58.646
Could it be possible
she went to see Terrius?

00:08:58.888 --> 00:09:01.152
Ok, you go to the theatre.

00:09:02.091 --> 00:09:06.027
The others, please check
around the hospital.

00:09:19.642 --> 00:09:21.803
A chilly wind
is blowing from the roof.

00:09:22.979 --> 00:09:25.209
Susanna!

00:09:53.843 --> 00:09:55.902
Susanna!

00:10:03.786 --> 00:10:06.755
Susanna!

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:30.702
Susanna, where are you?

00:10:39.856 --> 00:10:41.551
Susanna!

00:10:42.124 --> 00:10:45.355
Susanna, don't do stupid things!

00:10:45.862 --> 00:10:48.389
Susanna, your legs...

00:10:48.539 --> 00:10:49.657
Let me go.

00:10:49.807 --> 00:10:51.626
Please, let me die.

00:10:51.776 --> 00:10:53.726
Susanna, you...

00:10:55.004 --> 00:10:56.397
Candy...

00:10:56.547 --> 00:10:58.372
Susanna's legs...

00:10:59.408 --> 00:11:01.376
Now you understand, Candy?

00:11:03.813 --> 00:11:07.214
Let me go,
and pretend you didn't see me.

00:11:07.517 --> 00:11:08.810
Susanna!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.753
Staying alive will only
make Terry suffer more.

00:11:12.955 --> 00:11:15.316
You will never be happy.

00:11:15.466 --> 00:11:18.052
- Susanna!
- Let me die.

00:11:18.202 --> 00:11:20.322
For Terry, I must die.

00:11:22.732 --> 00:11:25.257
I can't let you do foolish things.

00:11:26.369 --> 00:11:31.363
If you suffer,
Terry will suffer, too.

00:11:33.776 --> 00:11:34.802
Let me go, Candy.

00:11:34.952 --> 00:11:38.074
I will only get between you too.

00:11:38.247 --> 00:11:40.654
Let go of me!
Let go of me!

00:11:41.851 --> 00:11:43.944
Don't do this, Susanna!

00:11:44.654 --> 00:11:47.555
Don't do this!

00:11:56.632 --> 00:11:59.430
Susanna is madly in love
with Terry.

00:12:04.674 --> 00:12:07.609
She was injured because of Terrius.

00:12:09.812 --> 00:12:12.804
It was not easy for her
to be able to play the role of Juliet.

00:12:15.217 --> 00:12:19.244
She became disabled for Terry.

00:12:19.422 --> 00:12:21.117
She loves Terry.

00:12:22.325 --> 00:12:23.883
I found her!

00:12:25.361 --> 00:12:26.564
Susanna!

00:12:30.066 --> 00:12:32.426
Susanna, why did you do
such a stupid thing?

00:12:32.576 --> 00:12:34.332
Oh good.

00:12:36.105 --> 00:12:37.572
Doctor, Susanna...

00:12:38.541 --> 00:12:39.838
Susanna!

00:12:40.543 --> 00:12:42.477
Please do not worry.

00:12:44.413 --> 00:12:45.610
Susanna!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.020
Is Susanna alright?

00:12:53.289 --> 00:12:54.586
Candy...

00:13:03.899 --> 00:13:06.732
Terrius, please take her to her room.

00:13:19.181 --> 00:13:20.608
Terry, your play...

00:13:20.758 --> 00:13:22.910
It is over.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:25.112
Hurry back to the room.

00:13:35.931 --> 00:13:39.458
Candy... she saved me.

00:13:53.282 --> 00:13:55.375
My arms feel so heavy.

00:13:55.818 --> 00:13:59.049
I can't go back now.

00:14:25.514 --> 00:14:29.041
Susanna's love for Terry
is the same as mine.

00:14:29.985 --> 00:14:32.620
This three people relationship
is not possible.

00:14:32.988 --> 00:14:37.357
If this continues,
it will only make Terry suffer more.

00:14:39.562 --> 00:14:41.756
If I don't make a decision,

00:14:41.906 --> 00:14:44.994
Terry would... Terry...

00:14:47.936 --> 00:14:50.969
Candy, Susanna wants to see you.

00:14:51.674 --> 00:14:54.142
She does? Just the right time.

00:14:56.112 --> 00:14:58.410
I wanted to say goodbye.

00:15:02.918 --> 00:15:04.180
Goodbye?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:07.481
I'll take the train back tonight.

00:15:07.631 --> 00:15:09.281
Back? Tonight?

00:15:09.925 --> 00:15:13.725
Terry, I was able to see you.
And my vacation is over.

00:15:14.296 --> 00:15:16.890
I am also very worried about Mr. Albert.

00:15:18.367 --> 00:15:19.766
Candy!

00:15:21.237 --> 00:15:23.899
Take good care of Susanna.

00:15:24.273 --> 00:15:28.107
If it had been me,
probably I wouldn't have saved you.

00:15:40.072 --> 00:15:41.048
Candy...

00:15:41.198 --> 00:15:42.216
Susanna...

00:15:42.366 --> 00:15:43.868
You are so beautiful and so gentle...

00:15:44.168 --> 00:15:46.662
willing to sacrifice everything for Terry.

00:15:47.563 --> 00:15:49.997
I came to say goodbye.

00:15:53.035 --> 00:15:55.029
I am going to take
the train back tonight.

00:15:55.179 --> 00:15:57.231
Candy, I...

00:15:57.381 --> 00:15:58.966
Don't say anything, Susanna.

00:15:59.116 --> 00:16:01.035
It's wonderful to be alive.

00:16:01.185 --> 00:16:03.804
Terry will be by your side.
I hope you will get well soon.

00:16:03.954 --> 00:16:08.282
Candy, I know the person
he loves is you.

00:16:08.584 --> 00:16:10.017
But, I...

00:16:11.153 --> 00:16:12.613
Don't say it, Susanna!

00:16:12.763 --> 00:16:14.849
No, let me finish!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:22.423
I don't want to get
between you too, but...

00:16:22.573 --> 00:16:27.731
Whenever I see Terry,
I feel alive again.

00:16:28.437 --> 00:16:30.428
It doesn't matter anymore
if I go back to the stage or not.

00:16:30.806 --> 00:16:34.333
I just want to be with him.

00:16:35.211 --> 00:16:36.838
Then let it be, Susanna.

00:16:37.246 --> 00:16:39.942
As long as you are happy.

00:16:40.182 --> 00:16:43.913
Candy, I am so sorry!

00:16:45.988 --> 00:16:47.813
Don't say that, Susanna.

00:16:47.963 --> 00:16:51.256
It's not your fault.
Please, get well soon.

00:16:51.427 --> 00:16:54.488
That would make me and Terry happy.

00:16:54.638 --> 00:16:56.254
Goodbye, Susanna.

00:17:00.269 --> 00:17:01.736
Candy!

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:06.470
Never let Terry go.

00:17:08.377 --> 00:17:10.072
Candy...

00:17:19.555 --> 00:17:20.548
Goodbye!

00:17:20.698 --> 00:17:22.090
- Let me see you off.
- Don't worry about it.

00:17:23.559 --> 00:17:24.852
I'll see you off!

00:17:25.002 --> 00:17:26.724
I said, don't worry!

00:17:34.803 --> 00:17:36.163
I'll see you off.

00:17:36.313 --> 00:17:39.002
Why make it harder?

00:17:40.676 --> 00:17:43.577
Terry you fool!
Don't see me off!

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:49.144
Candy!

00:17:58.994 --> 00:18:00.291
I don't want to let you go.

00:18:00.462 --> 00:18:05.058
Let the time stop here...
...here forever.

00:18:07.503 --> 00:18:09.095
Terry...

00:18:09.738 --> 00:18:13.606
Don't say anything...
If only time stopped here...

00:18:13.876 --> 00:18:17.539
He is crying... Terry is crying.

00:18:20.482 --> 00:18:23.978
Terry, my beloved...

00:18:24.128 --> 00:18:27.214
We are separating this way.

00:18:27.364 --> 00:18:29.664
Be happy... be happy, Candy.

00:18:30.893 --> 00:18:34.226
Or else I won't forgive you!

00:18:36.231 --> 00:18:38.927
Terry, you too.

00:18:52.748 --> 00:18:56.946
Candy didn't look back.
She didn't look back once.

00:19:00.923 --> 00:19:04.118
Terry, you can still change your mind.

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:06.753
Get her back, it's ok.

00:19:07.463 --> 00:19:10.921
Don't make yourself
suffer more for me.

00:19:11.166 --> 00:19:12.895
Susanna...

00:19:13.535 --> 00:19:16.537
The person I chose was you.

00:19:18.007 --> 00:19:19.497
Terry...

00:19:20.476 --> 00:19:25.175
That's right, the person I chose was
Susanna Marlowe.

00:19:26.715 --> 00:19:29.980
Freckled lady,
freckled Tarzan.

00:19:30.986 --> 00:19:33.045
The days of St. Paul Academy.

00:19:33.589 --> 00:19:35.420
The lost youth.

00:19:35.958 --> 00:19:37.585
Time can't go back.

00:19:38.694 --> 00:19:41.857
All the smiles, all the shines.

00:19:42.231 --> 00:19:43.698
Candy...

00:19:45.701 --> 00:19:48.499
I wish we'd have never met,
knowing it would have ended this way.

00:19:49.338 --> 00:19:51.298
What are you saying, Terry?

00:19:51.448 --> 00:19:53.398
I am thankful just to have met you.

00:20:18.233 --> 00:20:19.791
It's so cold.

00:20:20.135 --> 00:20:23.730
The train is tonight.
I should go back to the hotel first.

00:20:30.846 --> 00:20:32.539
Stear...

00:20:32.689 --> 00:20:35.042
Candy, this is a music box of happiness.

00:20:35.192 --> 00:20:39.952
Candy, you'll be happier every time
you listen to its music.

00:20:40.189 --> 00:20:42.214
Be happy, Candy...

00:20:49.064 --> 00:20:52.158
Terry, goodbye...

00:20:53.435 --> 00:20:55.266
... a real goodbye...

00:21:01.009 --> 00:21:03.910
This is enough.

00:21:05.347 --> 00:21:10.444
Candy keeps telling herself that
in her mind.

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:13.714
Thus...

00:21:13.864 --> 00:21:18.419
She opened Stear's
music box of happiness.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:22.196
And left her footprints
on snowy Broadway.
